# Bien moi truong: chan het, TRU file mau.
# Thu tu quan trong - dong phu dinh phai nam SAU .env*
# Vercel CLI hay noi them ".env*" vao cuoi file khi chay `vercel link`,
# lam dong phu dinh nay mat tac dung. Neu thay .env.example bien mat khoi
# git status thi kiem lai cuoi file nay truoc tien.
.env*
!.env.example

# Checkpoint cua cac lo do chay theo dot (Đ26, scripts/_batch.mjs).
# Day la trang thai chay do, KHONG phai bang chung nghiem thu — bang chung
# dat trong planning/**/evidence/ va duoc commit.
evals/runs/

# AI usage log hook (BTC AI20K, mau origin/feature/truong — G38). Giu .gitkeep.
.ai-log/*.jsonl
.ai-log/archive/
